{"seq":2,"slug":"sequential-logic","title":"时序逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/modeling/sequential-logic","wordCount":1246,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"时序逻辑\">时序逻辑</h1><p>给组合逻辑加上记忆，电路就有了状态，能随时间演化——这就是时序逻辑。它的核心元件是触发器：在时钟边沿那一瞬间采样输入，并把值保持到下一个边沿。计数器、移位寄存器、状态机、流水线，所有「有节奏地推进」的电路都建立在时序逻辑之上。如果说<a href=\"combinational-logic\">组合逻辑</a>决定「下一步算成什么」，时序逻辑就决定「什么时候把它记下来」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时序逻辑的灵魂是「边沿触发」。<code>always @(posedge clk)</code> 这个写法的意思是：只在时钟从 0 变 1 的那一刻，块内的逻辑才执行一次，把新值锁进寄存器；其余时间寄存器岿然不动地保持原值。这正是「记忆」的来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    D[数据输入 D] --&gt; FF[D 触发器]&#10;    CLK[时钟 clk] --&gt;|posedge 采样| FF&#10;    RST[复位 rst] --&gt;|清零| FF&#10;    FF --&gt; Q[输出 Q&lt;br/&gt;保持到下个边沿]&#10;    Q -.可反馈形成状态机.-&gt; NEXT[下一状态组合逻辑]&#10;    NEXT --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    D[数据输入 D] --&gt; FF[D 触发器]\n    CLK[时钟 clk] --&gt;|posedge 采样| FF\n    RST[复位 rst] --&gt;|清零| FF\n    FF --&gt; Q[输出 Q&lt;br/&gt;保持到下个边沿]\n    Q -.可反馈形成状态机.-&gt; NEXT[下一状态组合逻辑]\n    NEXT --&gt; D</pre><p>复位是时序逻辑必须考虑的另一半。复位让电路在上电或异常后回到已知初态，分同步与异步两种，二者的区别见下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复位类型</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>Verilog 写法</th>\n<th>取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步复位</td>\n<td>仅在时钟沿且 rst 有效时</td>\n<td><code>@(posedge clk)</code> 内判 rst</td>\n<td>不增加额外时序路径，但需时钟在跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步复位</td>\n<td>rst 一有效立即复位</td>\n<td><code>@(posedge clk or posedge rst)</code></td>\n<td>无需时钟即可复位，但释放需做同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"d-触发器-时序逻辑的原子\">D 触发器：时序逻辑的原子</h2><p>一切时序逻辑都可以归约成 D 触发器。下面是带异步复位的标准写法，它几乎是每个时序模块的骨架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 带异步复位的 D 触发器&#10;always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin&#10;  if (!rst_n) q &lt;= 1&#39;b0;     // rst_n 低有效，异步清零&#10;  else        q &lt;= d;        // 时钟沿采样 d&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 带异步复位的 D 触发器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!rst_n) q &#x3C;= 1'b0;     // rst_n 低有效，异步清零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else        q &#x3C;= d;        // 时钟沿采样 d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里用的是非阻塞赋值 <code>&lt;=</code>，这不是随意选择，而是时序逻辑的硬性规范。在时钟沿同时更新一排寄存器时，必须用 <code>&lt;=</code> 才能正确模拟「所有触发器同时采样旧值」的硬件行为。原因的完整推演见<a href=\"blocking-nonblocking\">阻塞与非阻塞赋值</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计数器与移位寄存器\">计数器与移位寄存器</h2><p>把 D 触发器组织起来，就得到两类最常用的时序构件。计数器在每个时钟沿把寄存器加一，移位寄存器在每个时钟沿把数据整体移位。它们都体现了「当前状态经组合逻辑算出下一状态，在边沿锁存」这一<a href=\"../foundations/rtl-abstraction\">RTL 抽象</a>的标准范式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 模 N 计数器&#10;always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin&#10;  if (!rst_n)        cnt &lt;= 0;&#10;  else if (cnt==N-1) cnt &lt;= 0;        // 计满归零&#10;  else               cnt &lt;= cnt + 1;&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 串入并出移位寄存器&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;  shreg &lt;= {shreg[6:0], serial_in};   // 左移并塞入新位&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 模 N 计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!rst_n)        cnt &#x3C;= 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else if (cnt==N-1) cnt &#x3C;= 0;        // 计满归零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else               cnt &#x3C;= cnt + 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 串入并出移位寄存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  shreg &#x3C;= {shreg[6:0], serial_in};   // 左移并塞入新位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时钟与时钟域\">时钟与时钟域</h2><p>整个时序设计都围绕时钟展开。一个时钟和它驱动的所有触发器构成一个<strong>时钟域</strong>。同一时钟域内的逻辑可以放心连接；但当信号要从一个时钟域跨到另一个频率/相位不同的时钟域时，会出现亚稳态风险，必须用同步器（如双触发器打拍）处理。跨时钟域是真实设计里最隐蔽的 bug 来源之一，<a href=\"../practice/common-pitfalls\">常见陷阱</a>会专门讨论。</p>\n<p>寄存器到寄存器的最高时钟频率由这条约束决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{max} = \\frac{1}{t_{cq} + t_{logic} + t_{setup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2935em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，两级触发器之间的组合逻辑越深，电路能跑的时钟就越慢。这把时序逻辑与综合后的<a href=\"../verification/simulation-timing\">仿真与时序</a>分析直接联系起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使能与流水线\">使能与流水线</h2><p>实际寄存器很少每拍都更新，更多时候带一个使能信号：只有 <code>en</code> 有效时才采样新值，否则保持。这种「带使能的触发器」是构建数据通路控制的基本砖块。把多级带寄存器的组合逻辑串起来、让数据像流水线一样逐级推进，就是<strong>流水线</strong>——它通过缩短每两级寄存器之间的逻辑深度来提升时钟频率，代价是增加了延迟（latency）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 带使能的寄存器&#10;always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin&#10;  if (!rst_n)    data &lt;= 0;&#10;  else if (en)   data &lt;= din;     // 仅 en 有效时更新&#10;end                               // 否则隐式保持，这不是锁存器\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 带使能的寄存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk or negedge rst_n) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (!rst_n)    data &#x3C;= 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else if (en)   data &#x3C;= din;     // 仅 en 有效时更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end                               // 否则隐式保持，这不是锁存器</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这里的「隐式保持」是合法的：在时序块里，没被赋值的寄存器自然保持原值，这与<a href=\"combinational-logic\">组合逻辑</a>里「不赋值会产生意外锁存器」是完全不同的——时序块的保持靠的是触发器本身，而非推断出的锁存器。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对时序的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使能</td>\n<td>受控更新寄存器</td>\n<td>不影响关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流水线</td>\n<td>切深逻辑为多级</td>\n<td>提高频率、增加延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键路径</td>\n<td>延时最长的寄存器到寄存器路径</td>\n<td>决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流水线是把数据通路做快的核心手段，它依赖<a href=\"blocking-nonblocking\">阻塞与非阻塞赋值</a>里讲的「一排触发器同时更新」的语义才能正确实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序逻辑用边沿触发的触发器给电路加上记忆，<code>always @(posedge clk)</code> 只在时钟沿执行一次并锁存新值。</li>\n<li>复位分同步与异步两种，异步复位无需时钟即可生效但其释放需做同步处理。</li>\n<li>D 触发器是时序逻辑的原子，计数器、移位寄存器等都由它组织而成，且必须用非阻塞赋值 <code>&lt;=</code>。</li>\n<li>一个时钟及其驱动的触发器构成时钟域；跨时钟域传输需用同步器防止亚稳态。</li>\n<li>最高时钟频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{max} = 1/(t_{cq}+t_{logic}+t_{setup})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，由两级寄存器间的组合逻辑深度决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时序逻辑","id":"时序逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"D 触发器：时序逻辑的原子","id":"d-触发器-时序逻辑的原子"},{"level":2,"text":"计数器与移位寄存器","id":"计数器与移位寄存器"},{"level":2,"text":"时钟与时钟域","id":"时钟与时钟域"},{"level":2,"text":"使能与流水线","id":"使能与流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"组合逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/modeling/combinational-logic"},"next":{"title":"阻塞与非阻塞赋值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/modeling/blocking-nonblocking"}}